<title>USA: St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said compared with Tuesday, barrows and gilts were steady. Interior Iowa moved a liberal 118,000 hogs Tuesday. Receipts fell short of estimate due to cold and snow, here today. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	230-270 lbs    53.00-53.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3  package 272 lbs    53.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4 shipment 305 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>Sows - Under 500 lbs scarce; over 500 lbs 2.00 higher.</p>
<p>    US 1-2	300-500 lbs    Scarce</p>
<p>    US 1-3	500-550 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>		    550-700 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>    Boars:	300-700 lbs    40.00</p>
</text>
